Description: A 1.5 hour Bioconductor workshop introducing repSpat for detecting repeated spatial patterns in spatial omics data. The workshop covers data loading, thresholded features, spatially constrained clustering, block construction, MMD-based comparisons, and interpretation of repeated spatial regions.
